          "id": "1776325881696",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776325881697_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Display the data from {{$context.$variables.final6}} for a maximum of 6 rows using MessageListWidget messages.\n\nDisplay Rules:\nTitle: Questionnaires Requiring Attention\nSubtitle: Overdue, due soon, or missing response deadlines\nDo NOT put any random data.\nMake sure to not repeat any information in each record to help with ensuring optimal space usage in the panel.\nSpecify the following in each record displayed ONLY when data is available. If the data of a field is not available, do not display such data, do not use things like N/A if there is no data.\n1.  <Questionnaire>: <Title> (Example: '598: Environment readiness' where 598 is Questionnaire Number and 'Environment readiness' is Questionnaire Title)\n2.  <ResponseStatus> - Last reminder sent: <LastOverdueReminderDate>. Next reminder: <NextScheduledReminderDate> (Note: Display just the date, without any timestamp)\nbadgeText: \n          a. Critical if Past <DueDate>\n          b. High if close <DueDate> in next 7 days\n          c. Medium if future <DueDate>\n          d. Medium if no <DueDate>\n\nImportant note:\n1. No self descriptions or self analysis. Nothing except what has specified above to be displayed. Strictly no extra sentences or summary apart from what has been asked to display. \n2. Do not display any timestamp."
            },
            {
              "id": "1776325881696_systemPrompt",
