              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using data  {{$context.$variables.final6}} generate well structured and indented individual emails (per questionnaire response) addressing the contact.\n\nFor each of the record got above, produce one communication suggestion with the following: (Note: Do not include all the questionnaires together, Each email is for one questionnaire)\n{\n    To: <SupplierContactEmail> for record with 'SUPPLIER' <QuestionnaireTypeCode>, <InternalRespondentEmail> for record with INTERNAL <QuestionnaireTypeCode>\n    CC to email: <WorkEmail> from {{$context.$nodes.GETPERSONEMAILINFOFORLOGGEDINUSER.$output.items}}\n    Subject: Action required: Questionnaire <Questionnaire> due <DueDate>\n\n    title: \"<SupplierName> - Questionnaire response overdue\" if <DueDate> is in the past or is today\n             \"<SupplierName> - Response due soon\" if <DueDate> is in the future\n             \"<SupplierName> - Response pending\" if <DueDate> is blank or null\n\n    description: \"Prompt the responder to submit their questionnaire response\"\n\n    actionText: \"Send Reminder Email\"\n\n    Email content: \n```html\n<p>\n<!--if <QuestionnaireType> is SUPPLIER-->Dear  <InitiativeSupplierContactDisplayName>, \n<!--if <QuestionnaireType> is INTERNAL-->Dear  <InternalResponderDisplayName>, \n<!-- Default salutation if if <QuestionnaireType> is SUPPLIER and <InitiativeSupplierContactDisplayName> is blank-->Dear user, \n<!-- Default salutation if if <QuestionnaireType> is INTERNAL and <InternalResponderDisplayName> is blank-->Dear user, \n</p>\n\n<p>\n  As part of our supplier qualification and compliance process, we require your response to the\n  <QuestionnaireType> questionnaire <Questionnaire>.\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  Due Date:\n  <strong><DueDate></strong>\n  <!-- If <DueDate> is blank or null, omit this line entirely -->\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  Timely completion is important to maintain your qualification status and avoid any potential impact to ongoing or future business engagement.\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  Please use the link below to submit your responses:\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  <a href=\"<QuestionnaireURL>\">Open questionnaire</a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  If you have any questions or need support, please contact us.\n</p>\n\n<p>\n  Best regards,<br/>\n  <DisplayName> from {{$context.$nodes.GETPERSONEMAILINFOFORLOGGEDINUSER.$output.items}}\n</p>\n```\n}\n\nNote: Please format Email into paragraphs with good indenting"
            }
          ],
